  "description": "Think. Build. Innovate. Compete. Step into the world of Web3, DeFi, RWA, AI, quantitative strategies, and emerging technologies at the Multipli Hackathon, organized as part of graVITas’26 at VIT Vellore , in collaboration with Multipli.fi . This is your chance to turn an idea into a working prototype, application, strategy, or innovative solution , get mentored by industry experts, and pitch your creation to an expert judging panel. Total Prize Pool = ₹40,000 Coding isn't mandatory — teams can also explore mathematical, quantitative, financial, strategic, hardware, or other innovative solutions. What Can You Build? Explore ideas in: Web3 & Blockchain DeFi & Real-World Assets (RWA) RWAUSD & Tokenization AI & Machine Learning Trading & Quantitative Strategies Drones & Emerging Technologies Or any other innovative domain Event Details Date: 19–20 September 2026 Venue: Shakespeare Gallery, Technology Tower, VIT Vellore Team Size: 3–4 members Eligibility: College Students Registration Fee: ₹201 including taxes Hackathon Flow 19 September 8:00 AM – 10:00 AM: Kick-off & Ideation 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM: Prototype Development 4:00 PM – 8:00 PM: Mentor Review & Build Sprint 20 September 8:00 AM – 1:00 PM: Final Development & Testing 1:00 PM – 3:00 PM: Final Submission & Pitch Preparation 3:00 PM – 6:30 PM: Final Pitch & Evaluation 6:30 PM – 8:00 PM: Results & Prize Distribution Judging Criteria Projects will be evaluated on: Innovation & Originality Technical Execution Real-World Impact Usability & Practicality Presentation & Demonstration Why Participate? Build something real Get mentorship from industry experts Showcase your skills and ideas Gain exposure to Web3, DeFi, AI and emerging technologies Compete with innovative student teams Potential internship/full-time opportunities with Multipli Rules Teams must have 3–4 members . Teams must complete and present their solution within the hackathon timeline. Both technical and non-coding/quantitative solutions are welcome. Partici",
