    "details": "<p><strong>Think. Build. Innovate. Compete.</strong></p>\n<p>Step into the world of <strong>Web3, DeFi, RWA, AI, quantitative strategies, and emerging technologies</strong> at the Multipli Hackathon, organized as part of <strong>graVITas&rsquo;26 at VIT Vellore</strong>, in collaboration with <strong>Multipli.fi</strong>.</p>\n<p>This is your chance to turn an idea into a <strong>working prototype, application, strategy, or innovative solution</strong>, get mentored by industry experts, and pitch your creation to an expert judging panel.<br /><br /><strong>Total Prize Pool </strong>= ₹40,000</p>\n<p><strong>Coding isn't mandatory</strong> &mdash; teams can also explore mathematical, quantitative, financial, strategic, hardware, or other innovative solutions.</p>\n<p><strong>What Can You Build?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Explore ideas in:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Web3 &amp; Blockchain</li>\n<li>DeFi &amp; Real-World Assets (RWA)</li>\n<li>RWAUSD &amp; Tokenization</li>\n<li>AI &amp; Machine Learning</li>\n<li>Trading &amp; Quantitative Strategies</li>\n<li>Drones &amp; Emerging Technologies</li>\n<li>Or any other innovative domain</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Date:</strong> 19&ndash;20 September 2026<br /><strong>Venue:</strong> Shakespeare Gallery, Technology Tower, VIT Vellore<br /><strong>Team Size:</strong> 3&ndash;4 members<br /><strong>Eligibility:</strong> College Students<br /><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> ₹201 including taxes</p>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Flow</strong></p>\n<p><strong>19 September</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>8:00 AM &ndash; 10:00 AM:</strong> Kick-off &amp; Ideation</li>\n<li><strong>10:00 AM &ndash; 4:00 PM:</strong> Prototype Development</li>\n<li><strong>4:00 PM &ndash; 8:00 PM:</strong> Mentor Review &amp; Build Sprint</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>20 September</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>8:00 AM &ndash; 1:00 PM:</strong> Final Development &amp; Testing</li>\n<li><strong>1:00 PM &ndash; 3:00 PM:</strong> Final Submission &amp; Pitch Preparation</li>\n<li><strong>3:00 PM &ndash; 6:30 PM:</strong> Final Pitch &amp; Evaluation</li>\n<li><strong>6:30 PM &ndash; 8:00 PM:</strong> Results &amp; Prize Distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Judging Criteria</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Projects will be evaluated on:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation &amp; Originality</li>\n<li>Technical Execution</li>\n<li>Real-World Impact</li>\n<li>Usability &amp; Practicality</li>\n<li>Presentation &amp; Demonstration</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Build something real</li>\n<li>Get mentorship from industry experts</li>\n<li>Showcase your skills and ideas</li>\n<li>Gain exposure to Web3, DeFi, AI and emerging technologies</li>\n<li>Compete with innovative student teams</li>\n<li>Potential internship/full-time opportunities with Multipli</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Teams must have <strong>3&ndash;4 members</strong>.</li>\n<li>Teams must complete and present their solution within the hackathon timeline.</li>\n<li>Both technical and non-coding/quantitative solutions are welcome.</li>\n<li>Participants must follow the event guidelines and instructions.</li>\n<li>The decision of the judging panel will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bring your idea. Build your solution. Take the challenge.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Register for the Multipli Hackathon at graVITas&rsquo;26!</strong></p>",
    "end_date": "2026-09-17T23:59:03+05:30",
